<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Aromanian Frasherot</book>
  <para style="h">1 Sãruna</para>
  <para style="toc1">Prota Epistolã Atsilor Cãtrã Sãruna</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Sãruna</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Sãr</para>
  <para style="mt1">Prota Epistolã Atsilor Cãtrã Sãruna</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Pavlu, Silvanlu sh-Timoteu cãtrã bisearica di Sãruna tu Dumnidzã Tatãl sh-tu Domnul Isus Hristos:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1TH 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Har sh-pace pri voi!<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Noi totãna lu hãristisim Dumnidzãlu ti voi tuts, aducãnda aminti voi tu rugãciunjili a noastri. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Noi adutsem aminti totãna nãinti a Dumnidzãlui, Tatãlui a nostru faptul a vostru a pistiljei, faptul a vreariljei a voastrã sh-arãvdarea a nãdiiljei tu Domnul a nostru Isus Hristos.<verse eid="1TH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Frats sh-surãri vruts di la Dumnidzãlu, tsi vã ari aleaptã, <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />cã evanghelu a nostru nu vini pãnã la voi mash cu zboari, ma sh-cu fuchii sh-cu Duhlu Sãmtu, sh-cu multã cãndãrsiri. Voi shtits cã cum avem bãnat namisa di voi trã ghinea a voastrã. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Sh-voi vã featsit imitatorlji a noshtri sh-a Domnului, sh-aprucheat zborlu namisa di mãri munduiri cu haraua datã di la Duhlu Sãmtu. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Ashãtsi voi vã featsit exemplu trã tuts pistimenjlji tu Machidunii sh-tu Ahaia. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Cã di la voi asunã zborlu a Dumnidzãlui nu mash tu Machidunii sh-tu Ahaia, ma sh-tu itsi loc s-arãspãndi hãbarea trã pistea a voastrã la Dumnidzãlu. Ashã cã noi nu avem ananghi s-dzãtsem vãrã tsiva, <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />cã singur elji aspun ti noi, tsi ashtiptari avum la voi sh-cum vã turnat di idolji la Dumnidzãlu, tra s-lji huzmitipsits a Dumnidzãlui atsel yiulu sh-alihioslu, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />sh-trã ashtiptari dit tseruri Hiljiu a lui, cai elu lu nyie dit mortsã, Isusul, tsi nã ascapã di nãrirea a Dumnidzãlui, tsi ma yini.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Huzmitipsirea al Pavlu Sãruna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Voi idyilji, frats sh-surãri, shtits cã vinita a noastrã la voi nu eara digeaba. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Ma dupã tsi nã munduim ma nãinti sh-nã tirãnsirã tu Filipii, ashã cum shtits, lom curaiu di la Dumnidzãlu a nostru s-dimãndãm trã voi evanghelu a Dumnidzãlui cu tutã cã avum multã ncuntrari.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-24">Fap 16:19-24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">17:1-9</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Cã inimusirea a noastrã nu yini di arãdeari, nitsi di nicurãtsii, nitsi di la ileili, <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />ma, hiinda cã nã aprovãm di la Dumnidzãlu tsi s-nã si pistipseascã evanghelu, ashãtsi noi grim nu tra si arãsim a oaminjlor, ma a Dumnidzãlui, tsi veadi ininjli a noastri. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Cã, nu avem ufilisit pute, cum shtits, zboari trã alãvdari, sh-nitsi nu earam tãmãcheari, Dumnidzãlu easti martir trã noi. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Noi nu avem cãftatã mãriri di la oaminjlji, nitsi di la voi, nitsi di la altsã, <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />cã va nã fãtseam sartsinã a voauã ca apostulji a Hristolui. Noi earam moali cu voi, ashãtsi ca muma tsi ari cãshtigã trã cilimenjlji a ljei. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Ashãtsi avãnda unã vreari mari trã voi, nã arsi s-vã dãm nu mash evanghelu a Dumnidzãlui, ma sh-suflitli a noastri, cã nã si featsit vruts. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Voi, frats sh-surãri, vã adutsets aminti apustusirea sh-munduirea a noastrã. Lucrãm noapti sh-dzuã tra s-nu lji him sartsinã a vãrui di voi sh-dimãndãm evanghelu a Dumnidzãlui la voi. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Voi sh-Dumnidzãlu hits martiri, cã cum him aspus sãmtsã, ndreptsã sh-fãrã cusuri cu voi tsi pistipsits. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Voi shtits, cum him aspus cu cathiun di voi ca tatãli cu cilimenjlji a lui. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Vã avem urnipsit, vã avem dat curaiu, vã him spigiurat s-fãtsets unã banã cu tinjii cãtrã Dumnidzãlu, tsi vã grãi tu amirãriljea sh-tu mãrirea a lui.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Trã atsea sh-noi hãristisim fãrã pãpsiri Dumnidzãlu, tsi cãndu loatã zborlu a Dumnidzãlui, tsi avdzãtã di la noi, lu ashtiptat nu ca zbor di oaminji, ma, cum easti di-alihea, ca zbor di la Dumnidzã, tsi lucreadzã tu voi tsi pistipsits. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Cã voi, frats sh-surãri, vã featsit imitatorlji a biseritslor a Dumnidzãlui tu Iudea, tsi suntu tu Isus Hristos, cã sh-voi hits munduits di partea a compatriotsilor a voshtri ashã cum sh-elji pãtsãr di Iudeilji, <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />tsi vãtãmarã sh-Domnul Isus sh-prufitsilji, sh-nã priaĝunirã sh-noi. Elji nu s-arsescu di Dumnidzãlu, sh-suntu neamitsi cu tuts oaminjlji, <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />nchidicãnda a noauã tsi si-u grim a pãngãnjilor tsi elji s-ascapã, tra si mplineascã totãna misura a amãrtiilor a lor. Ma nãrirea agiumsi pri nãshi.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dorlu al Pavlu tra s-Veadã Atselji di Sãruna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Sh-noi, frats sh-surãri, cãndu armasim fãrã di voi ti shcurtu chiro, cu fatsã ma nu cu inimã, nã cilistisim ma multu cu mari dor, s-videm dinou fatsa a voastrã. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Trã atsea vrum s-yineam la voi, ma multu mini Pavlu unã oarã sh-ninga unã oarã, ma Satanlu nã nchidicã. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Cai easti nãdia a noastrã, haraua a noastrã, icã curuna a alãvdariljei nãintea a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos tu vinita a lui? Nu hits idyilji voi? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Cã voi hits alãvdarea sh-haraua a noastrã.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Trã atsea, dupã tsi nu putum ma s-arãvdam, apofãsim s-armãnem singuri Athina,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:15">Fap 17:15</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />sh-pitricum Timoteu, fratili a nostru sh-colucrutorlu tu lucrul al Dumnidzãu, ti predicarea a evanghelu al Hristos, tra s-vã nvãrtusheadzã shi s-vã inimuseascã tu pistea a voastrã, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />tsi vãrã nu si s-ascuturã di aesti munduiri. Cã voi singuri shtits cã trã aestã him bãgats. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Cãndu earam la voi, vã prispusim cã va nã munduim, sh-tamam ashã undzi, sh-voi aestã u shtits. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Trã aestã sh-mini, nu putui s-aravdu ma, pitricui tsi s-aduchescu pistea a voastrã, tsi s-nu earat cãrtitã di cãrtitorlu, sh-munduira a noastrã s-eara dusã digeaba.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shtirili di la Timoteu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Ma tora tsi nã vini Timoteu di la voi sh-nã adusi buni hãbãri trã pistea sh-vrearea a voastrã, sh-cã voi avets totãna minduiri buni trã noi sh-avets mari dor s-nã videts, ashã di-cum noi s-vã videm voi. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Trã atsea, frats sh-surãri, namisa di munduirea sh-priaĝunirea a noastrã, noi aflãm curaiu di la voi prit pistea a voastrã. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Cã tora noi bãnãm dealihea, macã voi armãnets tu Domnul. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Cã tsi hãristisiri putem s-lji dãm a Dumnidzãlui trã voi, trã tut haraua tsi avem trã voi nãintea a Dumnidzãlui a nostru? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Noi nã rugãm cu tutã inima, noaptea sh-dzua, tra s-videm fatsa a voastrã shi s-mplinim atseli tsi lji lipsescu a pistiljei a voastrã.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Ma tora Dumnidzãlu a nostru, idyiul Tatãl, sh-Domnul a nostru Isus Hristos s-u ndripteadzã calea a noastrã cãtrã voi. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Domnul s-vã multseascã shi s-vã artirseascã vrearea trã un-alantu sh-trã tuts, ashã di-cum sh-noi cãtrã voi. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Elu si nvãrtusheascã ininjli a voastri, tsi s-hibã fãrã cusuri tu sãmtãsiri nãintea a Dumnidzãlui, Tatãl a nostru, cãndu Domnul a nostru Isus Hristos yini deadun cu tut populu a lui sãmtu.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Bãnari Arsitã di la Dumnidzãlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Tu soni, frats sh-surãri, vã rugãm sh-vã urnipsim tu Domnul Isus tsi, di-cum nvitsatã cum prindi s-bãnats sh-cum s-lji arsits a Domnului, s-bãnats shi s-artirsits sh-ma multu. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Cã voi li shtits dimãndãciunjili tsi vã avem datã cu autoritatea a Domnului Isus.<verse eid="1TH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Cã aestã easti vrearea al Dumnidzãu: sãmtsãrea a voastrã, s-mutats mintea di curvãrilji, <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />tsi cathiun di voi si shtibã s-lu tsãnã truplu a lui sãmtsãsit sh-cu tinjii, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />sh-nu cu sivdaia a orixilor ca pãngãnjlji tsi nu cunoscu Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Vãrã s-nu vã arãdã shi s-lji facã arãu cu zilii tu aestu lucru a fratilui a lui, cã Domnul easti arãzgãnãtor trã tuti aesti, ashã cum vã dzãsim sh-mãrtirsim sh-ma nãinti. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Cã Dumnidzãlu nu nã acljimã tu ni-chischineatsã, ma tu sãmtsãri. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Trã atsea, atsel tsi lã arucã hima aesti, nu arucã hima un om, ma Dumnidzãlu tsi nã deadi sh-Duhlu a lui atsel Sãmtu.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Trã vrearea frãtseascã nu avets ananghi s-vã scriu, cã voi idyilji hits nvitsat di la Dumnidzãlu tsi s-vrets un-alantu. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Cã voi u fãtsets aestã trã tuts fratslji tsi suntu tu tutã Machidunia. Noi vã rugãm, frats sh-surãri, tsi s-artirsits ma multu. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Cilistisits-vã s-bãnats tu pace, s-videts lucrili a voastri shi s-lucrats cu mãnjili a voastri, ashã di-cum vã avem ursitã. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Ashãtsi, va s-bãnats cu tinjii cãtrã atselji tsi suntu nafoarã sh-nu avets ananghi di vãrã.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pistimenjlji tsi Murirã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Ma nu vrem, frats sh-surãri, tsi s-hits tu nishtiri trã atselji tsi murirã, tra s-nu vã nvirinats ca alantsãlji cai nu au nãdii. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Cã, ma s-pistipsim cã Isusul muri sh-s-nyie, tutashã pistipsim cã Dumnidzãlu va li aducã deadun cu nãsu atselji, tsi au muritã tu Isusul. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Aestã ma vã-u dzãtsem dupã zborlu a Domnului, noi tsi va armãnem yiu pãnã la vinita a Domnului, nu va him nãintea atsilor tsi murirã, <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />cã idyiul Domnu cu ursirea, cu boatsea a arhanghilui sh-cu trumbeta a Dumnidzãlui, va dipunã dit tser sh-mortsãlji tu Hristos va s-nyeadzã protslji. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Deapoea noi tsi him ninga yiu sh-avem armas, va him arãchit deadun cu nãshi tu niori tsi s-adunãm Domnul tu tser. Sh-ashã va him totãna deadun cu Domnul. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Diznjirdats-vã cu un-alantu cu aesti zboari.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Dzua a Domnului</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Ti chirolu sh-ti sticurili, frats sh-surãri, nu easti ananghi s-vã scriu, <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />cã voi u shtits ghini cã dzua a Domnului va yinã ashãtsi, ca furlu noaptea. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Cã, cãndu dzãcã: “Pace sh-sigurantsã,” atumtsea un aspãrgãciuni ni-ashtiptat va cadã pristi nãshi, ashã ca durearili a amintariljei a muljeariljei greauã sh-nu va aibã ascãpari.<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Ma voi, frats sh-surãri, nu hits tu scutidi, tsi atsea dzuã s-vã acatsã ca fur. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Tuts voi hits hiljilji a lunjinãljei sh-hiljilji a dzuãljei. Noi nu him a noaptiljei, nitsi a scutidlui. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Trã atsea s-nu durnjim ca alantsãlji, ma s-vigljem shi s-him dishtiptats. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Cã atselji tsi dormu, dormu noaptea, sh-atselji tsi s-mbeatã, s-mbeatã noaptea. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Iarã noi, tsi him a dzuãljei, s-him dishtiptats, avãnda nviscut pistea sh-vrearea ca cheptarlu, sh-nãdia trã ascãpari ca acupiritura a caplui. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Cã Dumnidzãlu nu nã ari bãgatã trã nãriri, ma trã loari ascãparea prit Domnul a nostru, Isus Hristos. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Elu muri trã noi tsi, cum dishtiptats, cum durnjits, s-bãnãm deadun cu nãsu. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Trã atsea, inimusits sh-agiutats un-alantu ashã di cum fãtsets.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dimãndãciunjili di Soni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Ma vã rugãm, frats sh-surãri, s-lji cunushtets atselji tsi s-cilistiseascã namisa di voi sh-tsi suntu tu frãmtea a voastrã tu Domnul sh-vã urnipseascã, <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />shi s-lji tinjisits cu vreari ti lucrul a lor. Bãnats tu pace ntrã voi. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Ma vã acljimãm, frats sh-surãri, s-lji vãrghits ni-ndreptsãlji, s-diznjirdats atselji fãrã curaiu, s-agiutats nipututslji shi s-avets arãvdari cu tuts. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />S-avets cãshtiga, tsi vãrã s-nu lji-u toarni a vãrui altu, arãulu cu arãu, ma cãftats totãna ghineatsa ti un-alantu sh-trã tuts. <verse eid="1TH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />S-hits totãna hãrsits. <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Rugats-vã fãrã pãpsiri. <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Hãristisits cathi oarã, cã aestã easti vrearea a Dumnidzãlui tu Hristolu Isus trã voi.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Nu lu astindzets Duhlu. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />Nu dispretsuits prufitipsirili. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Tuti bãgats-li tu provã, tsãnets atsea tsi easti bun. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Dipãrtats-vã di itsi arãutati.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Ma idyiul Dumnidzãlu a paciljei, s-vã sãmtsascã tu tuti, sh-tut duhlu a vostru, suflit sh-trup, si s-veaglji fãrã cusuri tu vinita a Domnului a nostru, Isus Hristos. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Pistimen easti atsel tsi vã acljeamã sh-elu va u facã.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Frats sh-surãri, rugats-vã trã noi. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Salutats-lã tuts fratslji cu bãshari sãmtã. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Mi-spigiur trã Domnul cã aestã epistolã s-u cãntats la tuts fratslji sh-surãrili. <verse eid="1TH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Harul a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos s-hibã cu voi tuts!<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>